Clone: the copy is the type you started with
   Clone::clone(&name)   name: String   -> alloc::string::String
   Clone::clone(&votes)  votes: Vec<i32> -> alloc::vec::Vec<i32>

Checkpoint. What does each .to_owned() turn into?
   "hi".to_owned()                   -> alloc::string::String
   [1_i32, 2][..].to_owned()         -> alloc::vec::Vec<i32>
   Path::new("notes.txt").to_owned() -> std::path::PathBuf

Which type carries the impl: the one behind the &
   <str as ToOwned>::Owned   = alloc::string::String
   <[i32] as ToOwned>::Owned = alloc::vec::Vec<i32>
   <Path as ToOwned>::Owned  = std::path::PathBuf
   <OsStr as ToOwned>::Owned = std::ffi::os_str::OsString
   <CStr as ToOwned>::Owned  = alloc::ffi::c_str::CString
